        "id": 1000019
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-04T01:15:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes when we build Dawn with the latest Windows SDK (26100) D3D12 debug layer will report error when these render pass flags are not set but the DSV is created with the read-only flags.",
      "parentUuid": "6eb5b0f2_3b904250",
      "revId": "f88c414b472182a402322fdcb4d83bb16f4d5244",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b173eb01_c3d48b29",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/RenderPassBuilderD3D12.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 151,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000014
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-04T01:22:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But if we build with an older SDK and therefore this block is not compiled, it seems we will still try to use render passes but without these flags. Is somehow fine? I would think that\u0027s invalid use of the D3D12 API, so Dawn should just not try to support render passes on older SDK versions at all.",
      "parentUuid": "759b7563_60f7d6f8",
      "revId": "f88c414b472182a402322fdcb4d83bb16f4d5244",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b4dcdc94_6a16719c",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/RenderPassBuilderD3D12.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 151,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000019
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-04T01:35:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "D3D12 render pass won\u0027t be used with older SDK according to the code below, so we don\u0027t need to worry about the issues about D3D12 render pass when Dawn is built with an older SDK:\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/d3d12/D3D12Info.cpp;l\u003d95\n\nYou can see `info.supportsRenderPass` will always be false when Dawn is built wit h and old SDK.\n\n```C++\n#if D3D12_SDK_VERSION \u003e\u003d 612\n    D3D12_FEATURE_DATA_D3D12_OPTIONS18 featureOptions18 \u003d {};\n    if (SUCCEEDED(physicalDevice.GetDevice()-\u003eCheckFeatureSupport(\n            D3D12_FEATURE_D3D12_OPTIONS18, \u0026featureOptions18, sizeof(featureOptions18)))) {\n        info.supportsRenderPass \u003d featureOptions18.RenderPassesValid;\n    }\n#endif\n```",
      "parentUuid": "b173eb01_c3d48b29",
      "revId": "f88c414b472182a402322fdcb4d83bb16f4d5244",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
