      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-04T01:15:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On older OSes or older drivers D3D12 render pass is not supported so we won\u0027t enter this code path: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/d3d12/D3D12Info.cpp;l\u003d95\n\nI\u0027ve also verified it on Intel devices in our side.",
      "parentUuid": "fbec6fff_60690199",
      "revId": "f88c414b472182a402322fdcb4d83bb16f4d5244",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
