      "side": 1,
      "message": "Were these flags added in the same SDK version with D3D12_RENDER_PASS_DEPTH_STENCIL_DESC? Or later? I don\u0027t know how to look it up.",
      "parentUuid": "df9f3fb7_2060d55e",
      "revId": "f88c414b472182a402322fdcb4d83bb16f4d5244",
